00:12:37.350 --> 00:12:38.400
Right.

00:12:38.400 --> 00:12:42.540
So what we've done
is, the Cloud Function

00:12:42.540 --> 00:12:44.520
that we have developed,
the initial version

00:12:44.520 --> 00:12:46.320
was in Python 2.

00:12:46.320 --> 00:12:51.640
And it was making traditional
