00:12:51.640 --> 00:12:54.900
So if you look at the
competence in Cloud Function,

00:12:54.900 --> 00:12:57.590
we basically have
four major tasks,

00:12:57.590 --> 00:13:01.440
which is an object detection,
a label detection, a web entity

00:13:01.440 --> 00:13:03.895
detection, and URL generation.

00:13:03.895 --> 00:13:06.270
So what we have done is we
have taken the initial version

00:13:06.270 --> 00:13:08.910
of the Python code
developed by Shyam,

00:13:08.910 --> 00:13:12.450
and we have kind of made it
