the object that it detected.

00:25:41.490 --> 00:25:45.480
And it's used a localized
object feature of Vision API.

00:25:45.480 --> 00:25:50.070
And it's also used a label
detection feature of Vision API

00:25:50.070 --> 00:25:53.970
to come up with a word cloud.

00:25:53.970 --> 00:25:55.750
And essentially, look,
I'm not a machine.

00:25:55.750 --> 00:25:56.680
I'm not an AI expert.

00:25:56.680 --> 00:25:57.930
I'm not into machine learning.

00:25:57.930 --> 00:25:59.760
I'm just a software engineer.

00:25:59.760 --> 00:26:04.050
But I was able to literally
leverage Google Cloud Platform

00:26:04.050 --> 00:26:08.550
to spin up a fairly useful,
practical, so to speak,

00:26:08.550 --> 00:26:12.180
object detection surveillance
system, as well as

00:26:12.180 --> 00:26:14.400
an environment
monitor, with little to

00:26:14.400 --> 00:26:17.730
no effort, very little code.

00:26:17.730 --> 00:26:20.520
You don't need to have
